<title>GREECE: ATTICA ENTERP RAISES 96 DIVIDEND/SHARE.</title>
<headline>ATTICA ENTERP RAISES 96 DIVIDEND/SHARE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipper Attica Enterprises obtained shareholder approval for a 8.146 billion drachma rights issue in its annual shareholders meeting on Friday.</p>
<p>The company which operates the newly built Superfast ferries on the Greece-Italy sea route will issue 5,256,000 new shares at 1,550 drachmas a share. The subscription period for the rights issue will be announced at a later date.</p>
<p>Rights will entitle shareholders to one new share per five outstanding.</p>
</text>
